cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Scientific Resource Lab in your work, please cite it using the
  metadata in this file.
title: Scientific Resource Lab
abstract: >-
  Reproducible, bounded and evidence-first scientific computation fabric for
  autonomous research agents. Provides typed scientific contracts over
  canonical JSON, an immutable content-addressed artifact store with verified
  ingest, reviewed hash-locked capability packs, a bounded fixed-entrypoint
  local runner with hard resource limits, a deterministic claim router and
  planner, a JSON-first CLI, a read-only MCP interface, a static evidence
  portal, and a disclosure-sanitized LabExportPacket/v1 proposal-only bridge.
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - scientific-computing
  - content-addressed-storage
  - autonomous-research
  - contracts
  - evidence
  - bounded-execution
